>
  <p>Concrete steps are a safety item as much as a building element. When nosings chip, risers go uneven or the whole flight starts to rock, every trip to the door carries a little risk. <a href="/">Concrete Toronto</a> repairs and replaces concrete steps across Toronto and the GTA, front entrances and back doors alike.</p>

  <p>Steps fail from the edges in. Water sits on the tread, frost works on the nosing, and de-icing salt accelerates the surface breakdown. We form new steps with consistent risers, proper tread depth and a broom finish for grip, and we rebuild the base so the flight does not settle out of level.</p>

  <h2>What's included in our concrete step service</h2>
  <p>Every step job is priced as a complete package in a written quote:</p>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>An honest assessment</strong>: repair where the structure is sound, replace where it is not</li>
    <li><strong>Removal and disposal</strong> of the old steps where replacement is needed</li>
    <li><strong>Base preparation</strong> so the new flight stays level</li>
    <li><strong>Consistent risers and full-depth treads</strong> formed to your door height</li>
    <li><strong>A broom finish</strong> for grip in wet and icy weather</li>
    <li><strong>Full cleanup</strong> and curing guidance before we leave</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Part of the whole entrance</h2>
  <p>Steps rarely exist alone. They meet a <a href="/services/concrete-porches/">porch</a> at the top and a <a href="/services/concrete-walkways/">walkway</a> at the bottom, and the step sides often take a <a href="/services/parging/">parge coat</a> for a clean finish. Our crew handles all of it in one visit, one quote and one schedule.</p>

  <h2>Why homeowners choose us</h2>
  <p>We have poured concrete across Toronto for 15 years. You get a straight answer on repair versus replacement, a written price, and a crew that shows up on schedule.</p>
  <ul>
    <li>2-year warranty on every job</li>
    <li>Satisfaction guaranteed</li>
    <li>Free, no-obligation quotes</li>
  </ul>

  <p>We build steps across the GTA, from Toronto to <a href="/locations/scarborough/">Scarborough</a> and <a href="/locations/markham/">Markham</a>. See every area on our <a href="/locations/">service areas</a> page.</p>
